(property "Description" "Functional interface with logical connector names; no implied physical PCB pin numbering. | module | 300 MHz–8 GHz. External USB-C power 3.3–5.5 V, ≤65 mA specified. Use only this power method; no simultaneous bias-tee or external supply.; Located at existing S-band helix feed in an external weatherproof inline pod, not inside the handheld RF bay. Gain/NF at 2.2–2.3 GHz must be measured; product-wide nominal NF is not a guaranteed 2.2 GHz figure." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
